{"path":"coroutine/coroutine_handle/operator_bool","title":"std::coroutine_handle<Promise>::operator bool","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::coroutine_handle&lt;Promise&gt;::</span>operator bool","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/coroutine/coroutine_handle/operator_bool","section":"coroutine","kind":"page","summary":"Checks whether *this is non-null, i.e. the value of *this is obtained from the promise object of some coroutine. Equivalent to return bool(address());.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> operator <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks whether <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is non-null, i.e. the value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is obtained from the promise object of some coroutine. Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>address<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>If <code>Promise</code> is <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/noop_coroutine_promise\">std::noop_coroutine_promise</a></span>, this conversion function always returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>address<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code>Promise</code> is <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/noop_coroutine_promise\">std::noop_coroutine_promise</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/coroutine_handle/address\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>address</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  exports the underlying address, i.e. the pointer backing the coroutine <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"coroutine","title":"Coroutine support (C++20)"},{"path":"coroutine/coroutine_handle","title":"std::coroutine_handle, std::noop_coroutine_handle"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::coroutine_handle<Promise>::operator bool","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Checks whether *this is non-null, i.e. the value of *this is obtained from the promise object of some coroutine."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"bool(address()), or true if Promise is std::noop_coroutine_promise."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"address","note":"exports the underlying address, i.e. the pointer backing the coroutine"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":68,"c